{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"planks","model_identifier":"planks","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## planks\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..7.5, y -0.2..2.2, z -21.0..21.0 (size 9.5 x 2.5 x 42.0 u = 27 x 7 x 118 cm).\nPlanks: four sawn planks (1.2 m x 13 cm x 3 cm) in two layers, tied with cord at two points, carried on the shoulder. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.2.\n"},"description":"## planks\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..7.5, y -0.2..2.2, z -21.0..21.0 (size 9.5 x 2.5 x 42.0 u = 27 x 7 x 118 cm).\nPlanks: four sawn planks (1.2 m x 13 cm x 3 cm) in two layers, tied with cord at two points, carried on the shoulder. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.2.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"plank_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.75,0.0,-21.0],"to":[2.75,1.0,21.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[82,44,86.5,45.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[84,0,126.0,1.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[87,44,91.5,45.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,42,42.0,43.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,4.